  "body": "Wake to the beach, stroll to your favourite cafés, dine in the village, then return home to effortless coastal luxury.\r\n\r\nDiscover an exclusive collection of 13 premium residences for sale in the heart of Mairangi Bay - 7 luxury townhomes and 6 boutique apartments, thoughtfully designed for those who appreciate timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship and an effortless lock up-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nEvery home is finished to an uncompromising standard, featuring premium European appliances, intelligent home technology and elegant interiors that blend luxury with everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n• Just moments from Mairangi Bay beach, cafés and village\r\n• GMV Italian lift system\r\n• Gaggenau luxury kitchen appliances\r\n• Hansgrohe German bathroom fittings\r\n• Daikin air conditioning\r\n• Philips hue smart lighting\r\n• Smart door locks and advanced security\r\n• Zoned for Rangitoto College & Westlake Boys’ High School\r\n\r\nBlock A – Signature luxury properties\r\nOnly 3 Available\r\n\r\nExpansive 4-bedroom residences, featuring two master suites, 3.5 designer bathrooms, a private lift, a generous deck, a comfortable balcony and double internal access garaging. Some of the townhouses feature inviting sea views. These homes are an excellent fit for executive couples and families seeking space, sophisticated design and effortless coastal living.\r\n\r\nBlock B – Boutique Luxury Apartments\r\nOnly 6 Available\r\n\r\nBeautifully appointed 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartments offering spacious indoor-outdoor living, premium European finishes and an effortless lock-up-and-leave lifestyle.\r\nPerfect for downsizers, retirees and professionals seeking luxury, comfort and the convenience of coastal living.\r\n\r\nBlock C – Flexible coastal townhouses\r\nOnly 4 Available\r\n\r\nBeautifully designed 3-bedroom homes, featuring two living areas, a versatile multi-purpose room, 3.5 bathrooms, a private lift, a generous deck and a double internal access garage. Perfect for active retirees, professional couples or families wanting flexibility for every stage of life.",
